    "Nome": "card: DOOM1.WAD",
    "Arquivos": {
     "README.TXT": "ESP32-DOOM in CircuitSketch\n===========================\n\nThis card does not have the game yet: DOOM1.WAD is missing.\n\n1. Stop the simulation, double-click this card and use\n   \"Load from the computer\" to choose your DOOM1.WAD. The\n   shareware one works; the full DOOM.WAD and DOOM2.WAD too.\n2. Run it again (F5).\n\nThe WAD stays on your computer: the project only keeps its path.\nIt does not come with CircuitSketch because it belongs to id Software.\n\nControls (the circuit's buttons, the keyboard or a game controller)\n  arrows ....... walk and turn\n  Ctrl (A) ..... fire; in the menus, choose\n  Space (B) .... use: open doors, press switches\n  Esc .......... menu\n  switch (R) ... run\n\nThe screen also shows up in the browser: the Network panel shows the address.\n"
    }
   },
   {
    "Id": "cima",
    "Tipo": "pushbutton",
    "X": 112,
    "Y": 322,
    "Nome": "↑ walk",
    "Teclas": {
     "apertar": "t:Up|g:Cima"
    }
   },
   {
    "Id": "esquerda",
